{
 "dashboard": {
  "uid": "shop-exec",
  "title": "Shop \u2014 Executive Summary",
  "tags": [
   "shop",
   "L1-executive"
  ],
  "description": "L1 business view for the time range in the picker. Availability objective: 99.5 % of requests without a server error.",
  "time": {
   "from": "now-1h",
   "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "links": [
   {
    "title": "Down: Shop Operations",
    "type": "dashboards",
    "tags": [
     "L2-operations"
    ],
    "asDropdown": false,
    "includeVars": true,
    "keepTime": true
   }
  ],
  "templating": {
   "list": [
    {
     "name": "env",
     "label": "Environment",
     "type": "custom",
     "query": "lab,prod",
     "current": {
      "text": "lab",
      "value": "lab"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": 1,
    "type": "stat",
    "title": "Availability (objective 99.5 %)",
    "description": "Share of shop requests without a server error in the selected range.",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 0,
     "y": 0,
     "w": 6,
     "h": 5
    },
    "targets": [
     {
      "refId": "A",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\"}[$__range]))",
      "legendFormat": "__auto"
     }
    ],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "percentunit",
      "thresholds": {
       "mode": "absolute",
       "steps": [
        {
         "color": "red",
         "value": null
        },
        {
         "color": "green",
         "value": 0.995
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {
     "colorMode": "background",
     "graphMode": "none",
     "reduceOptions": {
      "calcs": [
       "lastNotNull"
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "id": 2,
    "type": "stat",
    "title": "Error budget left",
    "description": "How much of the 0.5 % allowed failures is still unused (100 % = no failures, below 0 = objective missed).",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 6,
     "y": 0,
     "w": 6,
     "h": 5
    },
    "targets": [
     {
      "refId": "A",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "1 - (1 - (1 - (sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) / sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\"}[$__range])))) / 0.005",
      "legendFormat": "__auto"
     }
    ],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "percentunit",
      "thresholds": {
       "mode": "absolute",
       "steps": [
        {
         "color": "red",
         "value": null
        },
        {
         "color": "orange",
         "value": 0.25
        },
        {
         "color": "green",
         "value": 0.5
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {
     "colorMode": "background",
     "graphMode": "none",
     "reduceOptions": {
      "calcs": [
       "lastNotNull"
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "id": 3,
    "type": "stat",
    "title": "Orders completed",
    "description": "Successful checkouts (HTTP 201) in the selected range.",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 12,
     "y": 0,
     "w": 6,
     "h": 5
    },
    "targets": [
     {
      "refId": "A",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "sum(increase(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",route=\"/api/checkout\",status=\"201\"}[$__range]))",
      "legendFormat": "__auto"
     }
    ],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "short",
      "decimals": 0
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {
     "colorMode": "none",
     "graphMode": "none",
     "reduceOptions": {
      "calcs": [
       "lastNotNull"
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "id": 4,
    "type": "stat",
    "title": "Checkout p95 (target 1 s)",
    "description": "95 % of checkouts in the selected range were faster than this.",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 18,
     "y": 0,
     "w": 6,
     "h": 5
    },
    "targets": [
     {
      "refId": "A",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (increase(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",route=\"/api/checkout\"}[$__range])))",
      "legendFormat": "__auto"
     }
    ],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "s",
      "thresholds": {
       "mode": "absolute",
       "steps": [
        {
         "color": "green",
         "value": null
        },
        {
         "color": "red",
         "value": 1
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {
     "colorMode": "background",
     "graphMode": "none",
     "reduceOptions": {
      "calcs": [
       "lastNotNull"
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "id": 5,
    "type": "timeseries",
    "title": "Orders per minute \u2014 completed vs failed",
    "description": "Completed and failed checkouts per minute.",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 0,
     "y": 5,
     "w": 16,
     "h": 8
    },
    "targets": [
     {
      "refId": "A",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",route=\"/api/checkout\",status=\"201\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
      "legendFormat": "completed"
     },
     {
      "refId": "B",
      "datasource": {
       "type": "prometheus",
       "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{env=\"$env\",service=\"frontend\",route=\"/api/checkout\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) * 60",
      "legendFormat": "failed"
     }
    ],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "short"
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {}
   },
   {
    "id": 6,
    "type": "text",
    "title": "How to read this page",
    "description": "",
    "datasource": {
     "type": "prometheus",
     "uid": "prometheus"
    },
    "gridPos": {
     "x": 16,
     "y": 5,
     "w": 8,
     "h": 8
    },
    "targets": [],
    "fieldConfig": {
     "defaults": {
      "unit": "none"
     },
     "overrides": []
    },
    "options": {
     "mode": "markdown",
     "content": "**Green** = objective met. **Red** = objective missed in the selected range.\n\n* Availability below 99.5 % or error budget below 0 \u2192 ask the operations team for the incident summary.\n* Follow **Down: Shop Operations** (top right) for details."
    }
   }
  ]
 },
 "folderUid": "shop-l1",
 "overwrite": true
}